{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0234_1000_p", "source_sha256": "485a1f451232e5fb6950a9bc134c443d84e3bf9f03db47a1146ccb771043986f", "ja": "真、新しい衣装はどうだ？\n何か気になるところはないか？", "zh": "真，新衣服怎么样？\n有没有什么在意的地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0234_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "5d8aa819be82151b4806e23e0ef8128f2658bc8e2aa8947a465a48510cfa7178", "ja": "いえ、バッチリです！\n素敵な衣装、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "没有，非常合身！\n这么棒的服装，谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0234_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "7e160fe74c4ee1cb85dc73fcdc773633e8f0ac797a78f0c3d40a765904d784c1", "ja": "すっごくかわいいし、動きやすいし、これなら、\n自転車でガンガン走っても平気そうですね！", "zh": "特别可爱，穿起来也很方便活动，这样的话，就算骑着自行车一路飞驰，应该也没问题吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0234_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c326042532a7c0a1f61132f62f35206ea0fc0112bc1dcbf66fc02b69b459488c", "ja": "そうだな。スポーティさもある衣装だから、\n自転車にもピッタリだと思うよ。", "zh": "是啊。这套服装也很有运动感，我觉得骑自行车再合适不过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0234_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "4ee01faae33390ec11110dee0356a25d2fbc72173ce4202a09a500f5fa4ff2ea", "ja": "はい。本格的なサイクリング用の服も、こんな風に\n体にピタッとフィットしたものがいいんですよね。", "zh": "是的。正宗的骑行服也最好是这样紧贴身体的款式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0234_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5395c4b8a42f961d3b4fd4625402c8b1887decbeb0c6f0552bab5dfefd5e1d9a", "ja": "へえ、そうなのか。\n詳しいんだな。", "zh": "哦，是这样啊。  \n你还真懂行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0234_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "ffaa39d880e961d506122e48fc7a8bafeb885002fd164318f5683403722a359f", "ja": "休みの日に、よくサイクリングしてますから。\nロードもマウンテンバイクも大得意ですよ！", "zh": "因为休息日经常骑自行车兜风。\n公路自行车和山地自行车，我都很擅长哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0234_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "4c264a8c27a20ad33eed42c63986def4aafbf386420e2ade383b23e3710cad80", "ja": "晴れた日に、風を切って思いっきり走るのが\n最高に気持ちいいんですよね～。", "zh": "晴天里，迎风全力骑行，\n那种感觉真的是爽到极点啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0234_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3ad5dc5b820432ed88b9fb1bae56eeb084de044365a1863801072e77f2d7d25e", "ja": "休みの日にサイクリングか。\n真らしい過ごし方だな。", "zh": "休息日去骑自行车啊。\n真会这样安排时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0234_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "5089e91b47b8153ec0fadf3773a69dbae3b7c107351a3780a7cd091d088018c2", "ja": "ショッピングに行ったりとか、かわいいカフェに\n行ったりとか、そんな気分の時もあるんですけど……。", "zh": "有时也会想去购物，或者去可爱的咖啡馆…… calcข้อความเต็ม", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0234_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "7576c198393f5644fbc0df3ede853c18faa610c86942d0c7963c4da7c26c64a9", "ja": "でも、アクティブな遊びも大好きだし、\nそういうところも含めて、ボクだと思うんです。", "zh": "不过，我也很喜欢活跃的玩法，这些方面也都是我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0234_1011_p", "source_sha256": "5aaca7c4c34ce2b024eb384ccf684baaa91a2ef2e30ef3b99ee84e35c37e2be1", "ja": "そうだな。自転車で走ってる真の姿を見た人が、\nかわいい仕事を依頼してくれるかもしれないし。", "zh": "是啊。看到我骑自行车时真实一面的人，说不定会来委托我做可爱的工作呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0234_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "4ad81cf5613816240ab0ce1dba7cb1b8aae537139386e80057ed59dbc69e7d31", "ja": "えへへ、そうなるといいなぁ……。あー、なんだか\nこの衣装で、自転車に乗りたくなってきちゃいました。", "zh": "嘿嘿，要是能那样就好了……啊——总觉得穿着这身服装，突然想骑自行车了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0234_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "31c3a35afb1ffc7c396eb88026d6a87ebd25890bb5ef47b25b7d5d7b2bbcfc9c", "ja": "これなら風の抵抗を受けずに走れそうだし！\nでも……プライベートで着るのはダメですよね？", "zh": "这样就能跑得更快，不受风的阻力了！  \n不过……私下穿应该不行吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0234_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9615a6c68e3c44d75e54ca74dd2d1df0d89aa5a87d8699dd9f654703c10c0fd9", "ja": "うーん、そうだな……。\nあくまでも仕事で着る衣装だから。", "zh": "嗯——，确实是这样……\n毕竟这是工作时穿的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0234_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "8aafb6dc49374b82280c74256584395659a854a9e21b2ee19ebcfeb8034f13bc", "ja": "ですよねー……。\nダメ元だったけど、やっぱりそっか……。", "zh": "就是说嘛……。\n虽然本来也没抱太大希望，但果然还是这样啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0234_1016_p", "source_sha256": "49da30ddcac4b625d5c77670fd1a23aa2fcedf33d5e7f5c12287d7c99c9d97fe", "ja": "んー……まあでも、ちょっとだけなら……。\n俺が付き添うっていう条件付きなら、いいかな？", "zh": "嗯……不过，要是只去一会儿的话……。\n如果条件是由我陪着一起去，那倒也可以。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0234_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "d572abd280a0f2310ac238170bde40a315d4bab94d0398dcd7ad3e969bd24a88", "ja": "えっ、本当ですか！？　へへっ、やーりぃ！\nしかも、{$P$}も一緒に……。", "zh": "咦，真的吗！？嘿嘿，太好了！\n而且，{$P$}也要一起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0234_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "4db776c26db1875a6832b79a19725005532827f9ccf9d55e90d8ff713dd71f95", "ja": "ボク、結構飛ばしちゃいますから\nちゃんとついてきてくださいねっ！　へへっ♪", "zh": "我可是会骑得很快的，\n请一定要跟上我哦！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
